    "instanceFormat": "Format: {((N,E),K) | N is set, E subset {(e, w) | e is N unorderedcross N, w is int}, K is int} Example: (({1,2,3,4,5},{({2,1},5),({1,3},4),({2,3},2),({3,5},1),({2,4},4),({4,5},2)}),5) Parallel edges: when two edges join the same nodes, their weights are added, and a certificate lists the pair once with the total. An edge written twice with the same weight, either way round, counts once.",
    "certificateFormat": "Format: {S | S subset E, S is exactly the set of edges crossing some partition of N into two non-empty sets, sum of edge weights in S = K} Example: {({2,4},4),({3,5},1)}",
